{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"cce15cc7fd65c9f16227e0f34f3b0514633bfb9ef883e0936d6560885eb025fb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1532},"chapter":{"number":13,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亚伯兰跟罗得分手"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["亚伯兰带着他的妻子与罗得，并一切所有的，都从埃及上南地去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["亚伯兰的金、银、牲畜极多。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他从南地渐渐往伯特利去，到了伯特利和艾的中间，就是从前支搭帐棚的地方，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["也是他起先筑坛的地方；他又在那里求告耶和华的名。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["与亚伯兰同行的罗得也有牛群、羊群、帐棚。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["那地容不下他们；因为他们的财物甚多，使他们不能同居。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["当时，迦南人与比利洗人在那地居住。亚伯兰的牧人和罗得的牧人相争。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["亚伯兰就对罗得说：「你我不可相争，你的牧人和我的牧人也不可相争，因为我们是骨肉",{"noteId":5},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["遍地不都在你眼前吗？请你离开我：你向左，我就向右；你向右，我就向左。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["罗得举目看见约旦河的全平原，直到琐珥，都是滋润的，那地在耶和华未灭所多玛、蛾摩拉以先如同耶和华的园子，也像埃及地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["于是罗得选择约旦河的全平原，往东迁移；他们就彼此分离了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["亚伯兰住在迦南地，罗得住在平原的城邑，渐渐挪移帐棚，直到所多玛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["所多玛人在耶和华面前罪大恶极。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["亚伯兰迁往希伯"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["罗得离别亚伯兰以后，耶和华对亚伯兰说：「从你所在的地方，你举目向东西南北观看；"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["凡你所看见的一切地，我都要赐给你和你的后裔，直到永远。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我也要使你的后裔如同地上的尘沙那样多，人若能数算地上的尘沙才能数算你的后裔。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["你起来，纵横走遍这地，因为我必把这地赐给你。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["亚伯兰就搬了帐棚，来到希伯 、幔利的橡树那里居住，在那里为耶和华筑了一座坛。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":5,"caller":"-","text":"原文是弟兄","reference":{"chapter":13,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/13.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/14.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/GEN/12.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}